  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1189887.svg\" alt=\"title\" width=\"386\" height=\"24\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/linear%20pipes/screen.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;一个资源包，将来自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a>&nbsp;的所有管道方块模型和纹理进行更改，使其外观更美观，并与 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> 完美搭配！</span></span></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty%20X%20Smart%20Pipez%20Mekanism%20Edition/screen/image.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"desc\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty%20X%20Smart%20Pipez%20Mekanism%20Edition/screen/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"desc\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此外，本资源包还包含了来自 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a> 的所有物品</span></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty%20X%20Smart%20Pipez%20Mekanism%20Edition/screen/item.png?raw=true\" alt=\"desc\" width=\"915\" height=\"454\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本项目将 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a> 的模型和纹理与 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smart-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smart Pipez</a> 的方块模型逻辑相结合<br></span></p>",
